        "pseudocode": "Input: W, b, S, x, y\nif same_cell(x, y): return dot(x, y) + 1\nelse: return 0\nTime: O(|S| \u00b7 d)",
        "code": "def tropical_ntk(W, b, S, x, y):\n    import numpy as np\n    def find_argmin(W, b, S, x):\n        scores = [(np.dot(W[i], x) + b[i], i) for i in S]\n        return min(scores, key=lambda t: t[0])[1]\n    i0x = find_argmin(W, b, S, x)\n    i0y = find_argmin(W, b, S, y)\n    if i0x == i0y:\n        return np.dot(x, y) + 1\n    else:\n        return 0.0",
